; Stationery · Spectrum — the 32 bands of the Medium: children of MeasureAudio (Audio.inc), one block each,
; differing only in BandIdx. Original work, MIT licensed.
;
; MinValue is below 0 so that a silent band still draws a stub (BandMin in the skin), and a full one reaches the top.
; The bands are read only while the bars move (group Bands: UpdateDivider 1 then, -1 at rest).

[MeasureBand0]
Measure=Plugin
Plugin=AudioLevel
Parent=MeasureAudio
Type=Band
BandIdx=0
MinValue=#BandMin#
MaxValue=1
UpdateDivider=-1
Group=Bands

